- **Behavior:** Routes from this neighbor (`192.0.2.1`) will now be prioritized over peers with higher preference values.  

> **Example adjustments:**  
> - Set `preference 90` for a critical peer to prioritize its routes.  
> - Use `preference 200` for a backup peer to deprioritize its routes.  
> - Verify with `show router bgp routes` to confirm path selection changes.  

Always test in a maintenance window to avoid disruptions.
