To address the BGP route flapping on your Nokia 7750 SR routers while ensuring stable routes converge quickly, use route damping with optimized parameters. Here are the CLI commands:

```cli
/configure router policy-options
begin
policy-statement "DAMPING_POLICY"
    entry 10
        action accept
