To enable automatic MTU adjustment for BGP sessions using ICMP messages on your Nokia 7750 SR, configure `path-mtu-discovery` for the specific BGP neighbor. Replace `<group-name>` and `<neighbor-ip>` with your actual BGP group and neighbor IP:

```cli
