To configure BGP to resolve next-hops using SR tunnels from the lowest-priority OSPF instance, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunn
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter
                        sr-ospf
                    exit
                exit
