- The fake ASN (4200000000) must be chosen from private AS range 4200000000-4294967294
- This breaks AS-path-based loop detection - use only in trusted, controlled peers
- All routes will appear to originate from the fake ASN
- Maintain consistent fake AS usage across all peer policies
- Test impact on route selection before production deployment
